<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-CELTA FIRE COACH CASTRO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CELTA FIRE COACH CASTRO.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish club Celta Vigo fired coach Fernando Castro on Wednesday, just three days after the coach had seen his side thrash champions Real Madrid 4-0.</p>
<p>The result enabled Celta to avoid relegation from the first division. The club has not yet named a successor.</p>
</text>
